  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BDMG &#x2013; Sustainable Bond</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will help BDMG structure a sustainable financing to increase its lending portfolio in companies that contribute to at least one SDG goal in the Minas Gerais State region. BDMG has done a technical cooperation with IDB and has identified 11 project categories eligible to receive BDMG&apos;s Sustainability Bond&apos;s resources. The transaction will consist in a sustainable bond for an amount of up to US$50 million with a five-year term. Framework and the second opinion for this bond have already been issued and approved with the support of IDB.</narrative>
  </description>
